This package is an UNOFFICIAL community Linux port of the WorkBuddy
international-edition client (https://www.workbuddy.ai), produced by
converting the official macOS build to run with a Linux Electron runtime.

- WorkBuddy, WorkBuddy AI and CodeBuddy are products/trademarks of Tencent.
  This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Tencent.
- All application content is downloaded from Tencent's official servers and
  is NOT redistributed by this package; conversion happens locally on the
  user's machine. The upstream software is proprietary; use of it is governed
  by Tencent's own Terms of Service and Privacy Policy.
- Auto-update is non-functional on Linux (upstream publishes no Linux feed
  for the international edition). Upgrade by rebuilding this package.
- Known functional degradations versus the official macOS/Windows clients:
  Tencent Docs deep-collaboration engine (native SDK is macOS-only; basic
  document read/write via cloud API still works), and the AI code sandbox
  (no Linux build; automated execution falls back to the real terminal).
- Do NOT report issues with this port to Tencent's official support
  channels. File issues with the community port project instead.

